            "review_title": "Review at Anrakutei Japanese Bbq - Mac Dinh Chi",
            "review_text": "Andy Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam26 contributions\n0\nHigh quality restaurant to dine with your family\nMar 2023 • Family\nA cozy place to have dinner with your family. The meat quality is good, service is fast.\nYou can choose between grill or hotspot menu.\nAlso, it’s your call to choose a buffet or a la carte.\nAlso, they have room for private dining as well.\n\nDessert is fine.\nWritten March 18, 2023\nAnrakutei_Japanese BBQ\n💕Dear Mr Long Le !!!\nThank you so much for visiting us and leaving such a great rating. We are very glad to know that you were satisfied with our service. We keep to try to do our better service from now on.\nWe look forward to see you again soon.\nWe wish you a beautiful week with full of energy !!! 💕\nRead more\nWritten March 20, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
