            "review_title": "Review at Anrakutei Japanese Bbq - Mac Dinh Chi",
            "review_text": "Ipi T\n3 contributions\n1\nANRAKUTEI Japanese BBQ.\nMar 2019 • Business\nJapanese BBQ.is actually S-Korean BBQ or Japanese running a former Korean style restaurant. \nFor S-Korean BBQ you have at least 10 different bowls with souses and other ingredients on the table and salad for the meat is usually included with the meat you buy.\nSo it was good but a bit a strange experience and I was missing all the sauces and flavors you have usually with a S-Korean BBQ.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 23, 2019\nAnrakutei_Japanese BBQ\nHello sir,\n\nI don't know where you got this information. But it is no right information.\nThis is the right information :\nAnrakutei Co Ltd. ANRAKUTEI Co., Ltd. operates a restaurant chain known as Anrakutei specialized in grilled beef based in Saitama Prefecture. The Company operates its own restaurants and also franchise restaurant. Anrakutei also operates coffee shops and book stores.\n\nAlso this time, we opened the 1st restaurant in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam.\nHope you will comeback and have a good meal !\n\nHave a nice day, sir !\nRead more\nWritten March 26, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
